---
// Toast Notification Component
---

<div
  id="global-toast"
  class="fixed bottom-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-50 hidden items-center gap-3 bg-purple-950 text-white px-5 py-3.5 rounded-full shadow-2xl border border-purple-400/30 animate-toast transition-all"
  role="alert"
>
  <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white shrink-0 text-xs font-bold">
    ✓
  </div>
  <p id="global-toast-text" class="text-sm font-medium pr-1 whitespace-nowrap text-purple-100">
    Ação realizada com sucesso!
  </p>
</div>
